  "question": {
    "text": "Which one of the following alkenes when treated with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> yields majorly an anti Markovnikov product?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Markovnikov&rsquo;s product is formed when a stable carbocation is formed on the more substituted carbon.</p><p>In <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></math> the carbocation formed will be destabilized by strong <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> group of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math> Hence, the Anti-Markovnikov&rsquo;s product will be formed.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0175_093e3f9ad56c.png\" style=\"width: 684px; height: 117px;\" /></p>"
  }
